वातरक्त n. (-क्तं) Acute gout or rheumatism.
 E. वात wind, and रक्त blood;
ascribed to a vitiated state of the blood and the aerial humour.

वातशोणित n. (-तं) Acute gout or rheumatism.
 E. वात wind, शोणित blood;
ascribed to a vitiated state of these two.

वातापिद्विष् m. (-द्विट्) The Muni AGASTYA.
 E. वातापि and द्विष् who hates;
also similar names, as वातापिसूदन, वातापिहन्, &c.
